# `agents.wire`

Graph payload (nodes + edges) for the agent-wire canvas.

**Policy** — read (C0, safe). Capability `ship.agents.read`.

## Arguments

| name | type |
|------|------|
| `id` | `string` |

## Returns

`AgentWireResponse` (JSON).

| field | type |
|-------|------|
| `agent` | `map` |
| `nodes` | `map` |
| `edges` | `map` |
| `catalogs` | `map` |

## Invoke

```
ship ops call agents.wire --json '{ "id": "" }'
```

Kind: read.

